flowchart TD
  A[Pin execution SHA and refresh baseline] --> B{Rollback window expired and selector healthy?}
  B -- No --> X[Block without deletion]
  B -- Yes --> C[Inventory every legacy file and active reverse reference]
  C --> D{Every row has replacement owner or timed exception?}
  D -- No --> X
  D -- Yes --> E[Close capability gaps]
  E --> F[Delete one ownership band]
  F --> G[Run parity negative rollback install and platform lanes]
  G -- Fail --> H[Restore band and record blocker]
  G -- Pass --> I{More eligible bands?}
  I -- Yes --> F
  I -- No --> J{At least 80 percent of pinned baseline removed?}
  J -- No --> X
  J -- Yes --> K[Exact-head review and retained manifest]
